* In this Project we are going to see how to create a Pizza bill


1) User run the application and see 2 options

   *1: Veg Pizza
   *2: non-veg Pizza
   
   
   if Customer press 1 for veg it will show veg pizza list 
   or user press 2 for non-veg pizza it will show non-veg pizza list
   
   
   //-----------------------------------------------------------------------
   
  *In Veg Pizza we declare 3 type of pizza : corn Pizza , Panner Pizza , cheese pizza 
  
  *for every pizza we declare seprate methods in PizzaSystem class 
  
  *same for Non-veg Pizza  
  
  //----------------------------------------------------------
  
  *After user select the pizza case will be executed in case we declare a method 
  
  In a method{ 
  -> declare price of pizza
  -> declare variable = pizza price  (add variable on instance level)
 -> call a method add extra cheese 
 -> call a method add extra toppings 
 ->call a method bill
 }
 
 ************(same for all case method just ,name change and price change )***********
 
 Extra Cheese method{
 
 in this method if user want to add some extra cheese we give option by using scanner class
 scanner class
 case 1 -> true
 case 2 -> false
 1 for yes 
 2 for no 
 if user select yes then (pizza price + extra cheese price = pizza prize  )(add boolean variable if true)
 if no (nothing will be added in bill)  (false)
 
 }
 
 //----------------------
 
 Extra Toppings method {
 
 in this method if user want to add some extra toppings  we give option by using scanner class
 scanner class
 case 1 -> true
 case 2 -> false
 1 for yes 
 2 for no 
 if user select yes then (pizza price + extra topping price = pizza prize  )(use same boolean variable if true)
 if no (nothing will be added in bill)  
 
 
 }
 //------------------
 
 Last method is 
 
 Bill method{
 
 if  cheese added
 (price = price + cheese)
 
 if toppings added
 (price = price + toppings)
 
 1st print pizza price :
 2nd if add cheese price :
 3rd if add toppings price:
 4th total bill:
 }
 
 
  
  